[0.001, "o", "Shares add up\u001b[36Gexac\u001b[41Gly t\u001b[46G its amount, and each Group's Balances add up to exactly 0.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mExpenses:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- The Payer\u001b[17Gdoesn't\u001b[25Ghave\u001b[30Gto\u001b[33Gbe\u001b[36Ga\u001b[38GParticipant.\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bdesc\u001b[16Giptio\u001b[22G is 1–200 char\u001b[37Gcte\u001b[41Gs.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BExpenses can be\u001b[23Gdeleted permanently but\u001b[47Gnot\u001b[51Gedited.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPayments:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- Can be recorded\u001b[23Gand\u001b[27Gdeleted.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BSe\u001b[10Gder\u001b[14Gand \u001b[19Gecipient mus\u001b[32G be\u001b[36Gdifferent,\u001b[47Gcurrent\u001b[55GMembers.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BThe amou\u001b[16Gt\u001b[18Gmust b\u001b[25G positive;\u001b[36Goverpaying\u001b[47Gis allowed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMembers:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- Names are\u001b[17G1–50\u001b[22Gcharacters\u001b[33Gand\u001b[37Gunique\u001b[44Gwithin\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55GGroup,\u001b[62Gignoring\u001b[71Gcase.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BA M\u001b[11Gmbe\u001b[15G can leave only once the\u001b[40Gr Balance is 0; they're kept in history.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BNam\u001b[11Gs can't be reused and l\u001b[35Gavers can't r\u001b[49Gjoin.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mBalances:\u001b[22m positive means the Member\u001b[41Gis owed m\u001b[51Gney.\u001b[56GEver"]
