[8.739, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[31B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/mattpocock-skills:to-tickets                          (mattpocock-skills) Break a plan, spec, or the current conversation into a set of tracer-bullet tickets,\r\u001b[57C\u001b[1Beach declaring its blocking edges, published to the configured tracker (edges as text in one file per tick…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m/mattpoc\u001b[12Gck-skills:to-spec\u001b[30G                            (mattpocock-skills) Turn the current conversation into a spec and publish it to the project issue tracker:\r\u001b[57C\u001b[1Bno interview, just synthesis of what you've already discussed.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[39m/\r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[K\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;4H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
